    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Variation Radio Buttons with Price &amp; Stock for WooCommerce is a powerful plugin that transforms your WooCommerce product variation dropdowns into visually appealing radio buttons.</p>\n<p>With this plugin, customers can instantly see the available variations, including the price and stock levels, without the need for extra clicks.</p>\n<p>This makes the shopping experience smoother and faster, encouraging more purchases and reducing cart abandonment.</p>\n<p>See more via <a href=\"https://shieldclimb.com/free-woocommerce-plugins/variation-radio-buttons/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">this website</a>.</p>\n<p>📺 <strong>Watch the full install and setup tutorial here:</strong><br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XLIqpgsstLM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Download our plugin from https://shieldclimb.com/free-woocommerce-plugins/variation-radio-buttons/</li>\n<li>At your WordPress admin, Go to Plugins &gt; Add New Plugin &gt; Upload Plugin &gt; Choose File (Choose the file you downloaded just now) &gt; Click Install</li>\n<li>Click Activate</li>\n</ol>\n<p>📺 <strong>Watch the full install and setup tutorial here:</strong><br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XLIqpgsstLM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>V1.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Updated</strong>: Tested up to WordPress 6.9 and WooCommerce 10.4.3</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>V1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fixed</strong>: Issue where variations show as out of stock when the parent product has stock management disabled.</li>\n<li><strong>Updated</strong>: Readme file to include tutorial video link.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>V1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fixed</strong>: Strike price/sale price order in Blocksy theme &amp; font size inconsistency in Kadence theme.</li>\n<li><strong>Improved</strong>: Vertical centering for radio buttons.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>V1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Updated</strong>: Updated with wp_enqueue commands, improve js and css. Improved UX: full radio option clickability and light/dark theme adaptation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>V1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Updated</strong>: Tested up to WordPress 6.8 and WooCommerce 9.8.1</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>V1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Replace WooCommerce variation dropdowns with variation radio buttons for better UX, faster selection, and higher conversions. No coding needed!",
    "description": "<p>Variation Radio Buttons with Price &amp; Stock for WooCommerce is a powerful plugin that transforms your WooCommerce product variation dropdowns into visually appealing radio buttons.</p>\n<p>With this plugin, customers can instantly see the available variations, including the price and stock levels, without the need for extra clicks.</p>\n<p>This makes the shopping experience smoother and faster, encouraging more purchases and reducing cart abandonment.</p>\n<p>See more via <a href=\"https://shieldclimb.com/free-woocommerce-plugins/variation-radio-buttons/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">this website</a>.</p>\n<p>📺 <strong>Watch the full install and setup tutorial here:</strong><br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XLIqpgsstLM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n",
